#  THE CORRECTION: Marg at the count = the count day's closing + what was sold that day after the count (before the first sale:
#  the whole day; during the day: the bills after the last bill number written; after the last sale: nothing). change =
#  counted - Marg at the count. A purchase dated the count day is named on its line (it may have been entered after the count).
#  It waits for the count day's closing and its sale lines (the next night).
#
